<section class="faq-hero">
        <h1 class="text-3xl mb-2">Frequently Asked Questions</h1>
        <p class="text-muted">Everything you need to know about shopping with Aura.</p>
    </section>

    <div class="faq-container">
        <div class="faq-category">
            <h2>📦 Orders & Shipping</h2>
            <div class="faq-item"><div class="faq-question">How long does shipping take? <span class="arrow">▾</span></div><div class="faq-answer"><p>Standard shipping takes 5–7 business days within the US. Express shipping (2–3 business days) is available at checkout for an additional fee. International orders take 10–14 business days.</p></div></div>
            <div class="faq-item"><div class="faq-question">Is shipping free? <span class="arrow">▾</span></div><div class="faq-answer"><p>Yes! We offer free standard shipping on all US orders over $150. Orders under $150 ship for a flat rate of $5.99.</p></div></div>
            <div class="faq-item"><div class="faq-question">How do I track my order? <span class="arrow">▾</span></div><div class="faq-answer"><p>Once your order ships, you'll receive a tracking number via email. You can also track your order on our <a href="/pages/track">Track Order</a> page using your Order ID and email.</p></div></div>
            <div class="faq-item"><div class="faq-question">Do you ship internationally? <span class="arrow">▾</span></div><div class="faq-answer"><p>Yes! We ship to over 50 countries. International shipping rates and delivery times vary by destination. Customs duties may apply.</p></div></div>
        </div>

        <div class="faq-category">
            <h2>🔄 Returns & Exchanges</h2>
            <div class="faq-item"><div class="faq-question">What is your return policy? <span class="arrow">▾</span></div><div class="faq-answer"><p>We offer a 30-day hassle-free return policy. Items must be unworn, unwashed, and in their original packaging. Visit our <a href="/pages/returns">Returns & Exchange</a> page to start a return.</p></div></div>
            <div class="faq-item"><div class="faq-question">Can I exchange an item? <span class="arrow">▾</span></div><div class="faq-answer"><p>Absolutely! If you need a different size or color, initiate an exchange through our <a href="/pages/returns">Returns & Exchange</a> page. We'll ship the new item as soon as we receive your return.</p></div></div>
            <div class="faq-item"><div class="faq-question">How long do refunds take? <span class="arrow">▾</span></div><div class="faq-answer"><p>Once we receive your return, refunds are processed within 3–5 business days. It may take an additional 5–10 days for the refund to appear on your statement.</p></div></div>
        </div>

        <div class="faq-category">
            <h2>👕 Products</h2>
            <div class="faq-item"><div class="faq-question">What materials do you use? <span class="arrow">▾</span></div><div class="faq-answer"><p>We use responsibly sourced eucalyptus tree fiber, organic Pima cotton, and recycled polyester. All our materials are OEKO-TEX® certified, meaning they're free from harmful chemicals.</p></div></div>
            <div class="faq-item"><div class="faq-question">How do I find my size? <span class="arrow">▾</span></div><div class="faq-answer"><p>Each product page includes a Size Guide link with detailed measurements. When in doubt, size up — our fabrics have a natural stretch. You can also contact us for personalized sizing help.</p></div></div>
            <div class="faq-item"><div class="faq-question">How should I care for my Aura products? <span class="arrow">▾</span></div><div class="faq-answer"><p>Machine wash cold with like colors. Tumble dry low or hang dry for best results. Avoid bleach. Our fabrics are designed to get softer with every wash.</p></div></div>
        </div>

        <div class="faq-category">
            <h2>💳 Payment & Discounts</h2>
            <div class="faq-item"><div class="faq-question">What payment methods do you accept? <span class="arrow">▾</span></div><div class="faq-answer"><p>We accept all major credit cards (Visa, Mastercard, Amex), PayPal, Apple Pay, Google Pay, and Shop Pay. All transactions are encrypted and secure.</p></div></div>
            <div class="faq-item"><div class="faq-question">Do you offer discount codes? <span class="arrow">▾</span></div><div class="faq-answer"><p>Yes! Sign up for our newsletter to get 10% off your first order. We also run seasonal promotions and exclusive member discounts.</p></div></div>
        </div>

        <div class="text-center mt-6" style="padding:var(--space-4);background:var(--color-bg-alt);border-radius:var(--radius-md);">
            <p class="fw-semibold mb-2">Still have questions?</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-muted mb-3">Our support team is happy to help.</p>
            <a href="/pages/contact" class="btn btn-primary">Contact Us</a>
        </div>
    </div>

    
    
    
    <script>
    document.querySelectorAll('.faq-question').forEach(q => {
        q.addEventListener('click', () => {
            const item = q.parentElement;
            const wasOpen = item.classList.contains('open');
            document.querySelectorAll('.faq-item').forEach(i => i.classList.remove('open'));
            if (!wasOpen) item.classList.add('open');
        });
    });
    </script>